 !                                                                               
 ! This test calculates the CCSD(T) energy of                                    
 ! Sr atom in an external electric field of 0.001 a.u.,                          
 ! employing valence-only Hamitonian                                             
 ! for effective-core-potentials.                                                
 ! Note the keyword .ECP in **GENERAL.                                           
 !                                                                               
 **DIRAC                                                                         
 .TITLE                                                                          
 Sr for ECP                                                                      
 .WAVE F                                                                         
 **GENERAL                                                                       
 .ECP                                                                            
 .DIRECT                                                                         
 1 1 1                                                                           
 **INTEGRALS                                                                     
 *TWOINT                                                                         
 .SOFOCK                                                                         
 .SCREEN                                                                         
  1.0D-12                                                                        
 **HAMILTONIAN                                                                   
 .OPERAT                                                                         
  ZDIPLEN                                                                        
  COMFACTOR                                                                      
  0.001                                                                          
 **WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                
 .DHF                                                                            
 .RELCCSD                                                                        
 *DHFCAL                                                                         
 .CLOSED SHELL                                                                   
 10                                                                              
 .INTFLG                                                                         
 1 1 1                                                                           
 .MAXITR                                                                         
 70                                                                              
 .EVCCNV                                                                         
 1.0E-8                                                                          
 .CNVINT                                                                         
 0.01 0.0001                                                                     
 **MOLTRA                                                                        
 .ACTIVE                                                                         
  all                                                                            
 *END OF DIRAC                                                                   
                                                                                 
  &RELCCSD TIMING=T, DOENER=T &END                                               
  &CCENER DOMP2=T, DOCCSD=T, DOCCSDT=T &EN                                       


 **************************************************************************
 ******************************* Sr for ECP *******************************
 **************************************************************************

 Jobs in this run:
   * Wave function


